  Clock, Calendar as CalendarIcon, 
  CloudSnow, CloudDrizzle, Loader2, RefreshCw,
  CheckCircle2, Bell, Copy, Zap, Battery as BatteryIcon, 
  Car, UtilityPole, Info,
